  "details": "I play with mixed input quite a bit. Index controller on my left hand and hand tracking on my right hand. There is a problem that the line for the turning gesture can get stuck until the next time you do the gesture. Can't confirm the same thing would happen the other way around. Since I can't do the gesture on my left hand.\n\nProblem is shown in this video: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WIZfM1MFI_w\n\nTo replicate this. Use index controller on left hand and hand tracking on right hand. Rotate with the gesture on your right hand. While rotating, move with the controller. And let go of the gesture before stopping with the controller. The line is now stuck there until you make the gesture again.",
